If the repository has a separate direct WebRTC implementation, determine whether it is necessary for voice morphing or another documented requirement before removing or merging it.

Important distinction

A Twilio Voice SDK call may use WebRTC for browser media while Twilio controls telephony and bridges PSTN participants.

Do not mistake the use of WebRTC for proof that two browsers communicate directly with each other.

Document the actual media topology and preserve the correct one for each call type.

